rf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, January to February came in under 90% of normal in 40 of those years. On the middle, February to March was at 38% of normal in 2025, and April to May was at 130% in 2026. Every grid had its driest year in 1988, and grid 23841 was lowest at 43% that year.</p>"}
